-Which one?

538
00:35:06,265 --> 00:35:07,585
Did he find a new girlfriend?

539
00:35:07,665 --> 00:35:08,745
No way.

540
00:35:08,825 --> 00:35:10,105
Why didn't he tell us?

541
00:35:15,945 --> 00:35:18,265
Anyway, I have to use the toilet.

542
00:37:22,265 --> 00:37:23,185
Luan Nian!

543
00:37:32,785 --> 00:37:33,625
Luan Nian?

544
00:37:38,025 --> 00:37:39,305
Are you okay?

545
00:37:47,865 --> 00:37:49,625
-Where did he go?
-Who?

546
00:37:50,185 --> 00:37:52,065
The singer.

547
00:37:52,145 --> 00:37:53,465
Luke.

548
00:37:54,745 --> 00:37:55,745
Sorry, but…

549
00:37:55,825 --> 00:37:58,225
No one was singing.

550
00:37:58,305 --> 00:37:59,865
Are you drunk?

551
00:37:59,945 --> 00:38:01,745
Can you continue?

552
00:38:03,785 --> 00:38:04,745
A toast to music.

553
00:38:04,825 --> 00:38:06,145
A toast to friends.

554
00:38:06,825 --> 00:38:07,785
A toast to good food.

555
00:38:07,865 --> 00:38:09,425
A toast to stupid people.

556
00:38:23,665 --> 00:38:26,345
I can't drink anymore.

557
00:38:26,425 --> 00:38:28,705
I want to go home.

558
00:38:31,385 --> 00:38:33,385
-Not bad, Luan Nian.
-You still have it.

559
00:38:33,465 --> 00:38:34,865
Pay up.

560
00:38:34,945 --> 00:38:36,545
Foot the bill now.

561
00:38:37,225 --> 00:38:39,465
I asked you to sing until morning,
not just one song.

562
00:38:39,545 --> 00:38:41,745
Thank you.

563
00:38:49,105 --> 00:38:50,185
Hey, hey.

564
00:38:50,265 --> 00:38:51,905
Hey, calm down. Calm down.

565
00:38:51,985 --> 00:38:52,945
What's happening?

566
00:38:55,425 --> 00:38:56,505
What are you doing?

567
00:38:56,585 --> 00:38:58,145
-Easy now.
-What's going on?

568
00:38:59,545 --> 00:39:01,225
-Girlfriend?
-Luke.

569
00:39:05,985 --> 00:39:07,025
It's you.

570
00:39:28,025 --> 00:39:29,305
Are you really her tutor?

571
00:39:29,385 --> 00:39:31,105
-Cheers.
-Yes.

572
00:39:31,185 --> 00:39:32,305
Private English tutor.

573
00:39:33,385 --> 00:39:33,945
Let's go.

574
00:39:34,025 --> 00:39:34,865
No.

575
00:39:39,185 --> 00:39:40,905
She hasn't finished her work.

576
00:39:42,385 --> 00:39:43,945
It's the weekend.

577
00:39:44,025 --> 00:39:45,385
What work?

578
00:39:49,825 --> 00:39:51,385
Are you done with the summary report?

579
00:39:51,465 --> 00:39:52,745
And here you are, at a bar.

580
00:39:52,825 --> 00:39:54,065
Summary report?

581
00:39:54,145 --> 00:39:55,225
Not done yet.

582
00:39:55,305 --> 00:39:56,705
Can you teach me?

583
00:39:56,785 --> 00:39:57,905
Sure.

584
00:39:58,665 --> 00:39:59,665
I'll drive you home.

585
00:40:02,225 --> 00:40:03,345
Wow.

586
00:40:03,985 --> 00:40:05,305
Easy now. Come.

587
00:40:05,385 --> 00:40:06,225
-They are working.
-I'll be going now.

588
00:40:06,305 --> 00:40:06,985
-Come. Let's drink.
-Let's drink.

589
00:40:07,065 --> 00:40:07,785
-Bye.
-Come. Let's drink.

590
00:40:07,865 --> 00:40:09,025
Let's drink.

591
00:40:19,025 --> 00:40:20,705
-Stand straight.
-Stand straight.

592
00:40:21,825 --> 00:40:23,025
I'll buy some water to sober you up.

593
00:40:23,105 --> 00:40:25,145
I'll buy some water to sober you up.

594
00:40:25,225 --> 00:40:26,265
Stand straight!

595
00:40:28,665 --> 00:40:30,105
You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

596
00:40:31,265 --> 00:40:33,625
How can you be this handsome

597
00:40:34,145 --> 00:40:35,465
when you're angry?

598
00:40:36,785 --> 00:40:37,705
Stop it.

599
00:40:40,785 --> 00:40:41,625
What?

600
00:40:42,865 --> 00:40:44,785
They say you are very mean,

601
00:40:44,865 --> 00:40:46,505
but I don't think so.

602
00:40:47,665 --> 00:40:50,385
You just have a duck bill.

603
00:40:51,745 --> 00:40:53,745
A duck bill. You know what?

604
00:40:54,265 --> 00:40:56,705
A duck bill is like this.

605
00:40:58,705 --> 00:40:59,785
Useless Lumi.

606
00:41:00,305 --> 00:41:01,865
Look.

607
00:41:05,865 --> 00:41:06,905
Like this.

608
00:41:07,585 --> 00:41:09,385
You keep appearing in my dreams.

609
00:41:09,465 --> 00:41:10,665
Like this.

610
00:41:11,505 --> 00:41:12,585
What happened in the dream?

611
00:41:14,385 --> 00:41:15,865
I…

612
00:41:17,505 --> 00:41:18,705
I…

613
00:41:20,505 --> 00:41:22,185
I was scolding you.

614
00:41:23,585 --> 00:41:26,385
You wish. Shang Zhitao.

615
00:41:27,665 --> 00:41:30,625
It's time for you to lose weight
because you're about to break my arms.

616
00:41:30,705 --> 00:41:31,905
Luan Nian!

617
00:41:32,745 --> 00:41:35,385
My dad tells me to eat more.

618
00:41:35,465 --> 00:41:37,065
Otherwise, a strong gust of wind
will blow me away.

619
00:41:38,145 --> 00:41:39,305
Tell your father not to worry

620
00:41:39,385 --> 00:41:40,905
because you have aced that task.

621
