Is your dad good to you?

622
00:41:50,625 --> 00:41:51,665
Is your dad not good to you?

623
00:41:54,785 --> 00:41:56,465
Does he know you're stupid?

624
00:41:57,345 --> 00:41:58,265
You're drinking
when your ankle is barely healed.

625
00:42:00,665 --> 00:42:02,265
Do not underestimate me.

626
00:42:03,345 --> 00:42:05,065
I am slow,

627
00:42:05,585 --> 00:42:10,785
but every step I take is very real.

628
00:42:15,185 --> 00:42:16,505
See?

629
00:42:16,585 --> 00:42:18,625
-Did you see it?
-Yes.

630
00:42:19,265 --> 00:42:20,225
Let me show you.

631
00:42:26,065 --> 00:42:27,825
Yes, very real. Come.

632
00:42:33,665 --> 00:42:35,305
Mister. To Tiantong Dongyuan.

633
00:42:35,385 --> 00:42:36,465
To Tiantongyuan.

634
00:42:45,905 --> 00:42:50,305
SHANG ZHITAO

635
00:42:56,425 --> 00:42:59,225
SUN YU

636
00:43:05,505 --> 00:43:08,865
TIANTONG DONGYUAN, SECTION 1

637
00:43:15,345 --> 00:43:16,705
Over there.

638
00:43:30,865 --> 00:43:31,905
Sixty what?

639
00:43:34,025 --> 00:43:35,065
6…

640
00:43:35,825 --> 00:43:38,025
602.

641
00:43:38,705 --> 00:43:39,825
Sunflower.

642
00:43:39,905 --> 00:43:41,745
The one with a sunflower.

643
00:43:48,825 --> 00:43:49,945
Sit down.

644
00:43:59,145 --> 00:44:00,545
I am not drunk.

645
00:44:02,785 --> 00:44:04,785
Who is it?

646
00:44:06,265 --> 00:44:07,585
Who are you?

647
00:44:09,625 --> 00:44:10,985
Crazy.

648
00:44:12,465 --> 00:44:13,665
Sun Yu.

649
00:44:15,185 --> 00:44:16,265
Sun Yu!

650
00:44:16,345 --> 00:44:19,025
Stop it, or I'll call the police.

651
00:44:28,745 --> 00:44:29,865
Where is your home?

652
00:44:31,905 --> 00:44:33,785
I don't know.

653
00:44:35,065 --> 00:44:36,585
I want to sleep.

654
00:44:42,505 --> 00:44:44,065
Does it still hurt?

655
00:44:45,705 --> 00:44:46,545
No.

656
00:44:53,905 --> 00:44:56,185
